  "bio": "Tony Justice, based in Gijón, Spain, is an adept tattoo artist who specializes in the new school style, bringing a unique and modern approach to his craft. You can find a vibrant display of his skilful cartoon tattoos and other pieces under his Instagram handle @fat_tony_tattoo, which bear testimonial to his incredible ability to bring art to life on the skin. Belonging to the professional teams @sumuntattoo, @xtremetattooink and @emalla.official, you can be assured of the high skill level Tony brings to each piece.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Gijón, Principality Of Asturias, Spain"
